WEBVTT

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:01.850
Shoot, Hoshi!

00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:02.730
Aw, man...

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:03.630
Rebound!

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:04.750
Foul!

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.270
What?!

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.030
Why?

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.920
<i>I hated PE class.</i>

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:13.800
<i>I had the legit reason that my
doctor told me not to participate,</i>

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.440
<i>but my grade was always a 1.</i>

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:19.940
<i>Simply because of the status I was born with,</i>

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:22.270
<i>I never scored any higher than a 1.</i>

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:27.870
<i>That's why I decided I needed to find 
my identity elsewhere.</i>

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:33.510
I want to invent a drug that'll 
cure the disease Mom and I have.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.120
Pharmaceutical school is a 
six-year course, right?

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.810
And we can't afford a private school.

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:41.800
There are always scholarships...

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:45.730
<b>Pharmaceutical Department</b>

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.260
I'll study my hardest, I promise.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:47.420
Well, you'll have to study 
much harder than you do now.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:48.470
I know.

00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:50.050
You can do it, Kusue.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:51.230
Yeah.

00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:52.530
<i>But...</i>

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:00.810
Huh?!

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:01.610
Wha?!

00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:02.590
Wind!

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:11.930
<i>But...</i>

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:13.950
Shit!

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:15.730
Did they all get taken out?!

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:18.250
Don't go out there! 
They won't find us in here.

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:20.290
I found more! Kill them!

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:33.810
<i>But... one day, out of nowhere...</i>

00:01:36.190 --> 00:01:39.260
Hero, we've found your three friends!

00:01:40.790 --> 00:01:41.800
Ugh...

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:42.980
Gruesome...

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:46.700
<i>The violence that had always 
been meaningless to me</i>

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:51.390
<i>became the most vital skill 
I needed to stay alive.</i>

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:54.590
Hey! Did you look in that hut?

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:58.590
Don't forget to take anything worth 
selling before you burn it down!

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:00.460
Hey, here's a good one.

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:02.010
I'll be taking this.

00:02:02.220 --> 00:02:05.420
We'll be dividing it all up later. 
Throw it on the pile.

00:02:05.690 --> 00:02:08.580
<i>The sensation of the ground 
giving out beneath my feet...</i>

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:11.910
<i>Forget finding my identity.</i>

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:18.940
<i>My basic prerequisites for 
living changed completely.</i>

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:22.960
<i>The prerequisite that everything 
stayed peaceful...</i>

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:33.090
<i>I'm...</i>

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:12.390
We should let the horses rest soon.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:14.320
Let's make camp nearby.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:17.330
Yeah. The sun's setting soon, anyway.

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:23.320
Wow, this is good.

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.200
It really is.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.680
Aw...

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.300
You still can't eat?

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:31.840
Just one bite...

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:34.090
That was a pretty gruesome sight.

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:34.920
Yeah.

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:42.010
What happened back there is still burned 
into my retinas. It won't go away.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:45.190
It's not a big deal if 
you have no appetite.

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:48.550
We don't really get hungry 
in this world, anyway.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:49.660
I...

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:53.570
I want to protect everyone.

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:55.460
Huh?

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:59.520
My friends... and the people of this world.

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:03.230
But I can't even protect myself.

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:05.100
All I do is hold everyone back.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:06.680
Kusue...

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:09.450
I don't know if I can handle this.

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:16.830
I feel bad making the hero 
do the cooking, though.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:20.590
Oh, don't worry about it. 
Cooking is my thing.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:23.500
He just wants the experience points.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.530
Now that I'm rank 10,

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:28.180
I can use big pots and cooking utensils.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.260
Rank?

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:32.660
Yotsuya-kun seems just fine.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:33.750
Yeah...

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:39.110
<i>It's always the same. The ones with 
the physical strength gain levels,</i>

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:40.990
<i>and they get access to everything.</i>

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:42.060
Great Hero.

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:44.810
Oh, back for seconds?

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:46.940
Let's begin our training now!

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:48.320
Training?

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:52.030
You said before that she 
helped train you, right?

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:52.880
Yeah.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:57.080
Out of 100 matches, all with handicaps, 
I only beat her three times.

00:05:58.030 --> 00:05:59.910
In fact, at some point,

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:03.370
she switched to a real sword and started 
hacking me up within an inch of my life.

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:05.810
I thought I was in Hell.

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:08.530
A-An inch of your life?

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:11.370
Come to think of it, when she rescued us...

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:16.310
I want you to let me train the 
four of you with the sword!

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.050
Since you're heroes,

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:22.230
I can slice you up all I want with a 
real sword, and it won't be a problem!

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:24.700
Um...

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:28.150
I mean, since we don't have 
any other options, sure.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:31.570
Excellent! Now I can slice up 
flesh to my heart's content!

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:35.540
Yay! I should go tell my dad right away!

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:38.750
And she sounded so happy about it.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.700
I have so many bad feelings...

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:42.140
Okay, let's start with you.

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:45.320
Eep! For real?!

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:48.510
I'll begin attacking after five seconds.

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:49.260
Okay...

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:52.870
There's nothing I love more 
than cleaving the flesh...

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:55.550
of living things!

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:57.710
<i>What's her deal, exactly?</i>

00:06:57.710 --> 00:07:00.990
<i>Her looks are on point, 
but man... talk about whiplash.</i>

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:06.890
Yuka-san, are you okay?

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.990
I couldn't be worse!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:12.610
I know sensations of pain in this world are 
only 1/36th of what we'd feel in our world,

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:15.420
but being sliced up still hurts!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.110
Okay, next is...

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:27.160
So you can't even lift a longsword?

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:29.120
This will take some time.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:34.650
<i>The modern Japan that I 
lived in was so peaceful.</i>

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:37.480
What happened?!

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:42.260
We were attacked by goblins while 
gathering firewood, and Makuah was...

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:44.470
I got too careless.

00:07:44.470 --> 00:07:46.330
How could you be injured by goblins?

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:47.850
And you call yourself my subordinate?

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:50.040
I-I'm so sorry!

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:55.500
<i>When I came to this world, 
everything fell apart.</i>

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:03.650
The wound is going away...

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:07.290
I didn't know you could use healing magic.

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:10.430
I'm accelerating his cellular metabolism

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:12.800
to make his wound heal itself faster.

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:17.340
I can't surpass his natural regenerative 
ability, but I can do this.

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:21.970
Just like when you were a Chef, you can 
gain experience without even fighting.

00:08:21.970 --> 00:08:23.780
Isn't that kinda unfair?

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:27.640
Well, don't complain to me about it. 
Take it up with the system.

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:30.610
<i>The system...</i>

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:35.870
<i>We can't escape this system 
we've been forced into.</i>

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.200
<i>I want to protect everyone!</i>

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:43.120
<i>To do that, I have to gain 
experience points...</i>

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:46.030
<i>and get much stronger!</i>

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:48.750
You're moving much better now.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:57.310
Still going to need more time before we 
start with the longsword, though...

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.510
<i>I have to get more experience points...</i>

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:08.860
We've found a horde of goblins.

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:10.530
Shall we take a detour?

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:13.790
No, it'll be faster to wipe 
them all out ourselves.

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:15.320
Ah, no.

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:17.320
We'll handle it.

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:20.660
All we've done lately is train,

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:23.320
so we haven't gained any experience.

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:24.070
That's true.

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:28.000
Yeah, as if <i>you</i> haven't been getting 
experience by healing people.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:29.910
Coming, Kusue?

00:09:30.820 --> 00:09:32.880
You don't have to if you don't want to.

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:34.590
O-Okay...

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:37.510
All right! Let's get to work!

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:45.950
I don't think a longsword is 
necessary against mere goblins,

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.600
but I'm still concerned.

00:09:49.440 --> 00:09:50.640
Fire!

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:52.010
Wind!

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:00.700
Great Hero!

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:25.480
I'm sorry...

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:28.860
I'm sorry...

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:31.760
I'm sorry... I'm sorry...

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:34.690
I'm sorry!

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:39.610
<b>Yotsuya Yuusuke</b>

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:39.610
