00:10:35.130 --> 00:10:39.210
After all that work, 
it barely went up at all.

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:43.520
Probably because your rank's 
already higher than any of ours.

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:46.420
Kusue, I heard you defeated a goblin.

00:10:46.420 --> 00:10:49.280
Yeah... somehow...

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:50.790
You finally did it, huh?

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:51.700
Yeah.

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:54.430
<i>I can still feel it in my hands...</i>

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:59.770
<i>That squishing feeling 
of flesh giving way...</i>

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:07.980
I'm truly happy that you've come 
into your own as a sword wielder!

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:09.850
However...

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:11.300
Yes?

00:11:11.630 --> 00:11:15.230
I'm sad that I didn't get to slice 
any goblin flesh with my own hands.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:16.360
Uh...

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:21.400
So... why do you enjoy cutting 
living flesh so much?

00:11:21.970 --> 00:11:23.710
I'm glad you asked!

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:25.820
There are countless great 
things about living flesh!

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.750
First, the firmness of muscle!

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:31.040
When the fibers of a muscle that's 
in active motion during combat

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:34.320
split like fraying threads 
at the end of my blade...

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:38.460
The sensation as it progresses from 
living to dead, from the outside in...

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:39.660
These are the things

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:45.000
that happen within the brief instant 
after I swing my sword downward!

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:48.390
And the way it feels on my hands when I do!

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:51.260
All of it is simply intoxicating!

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:59.910
Anyway, there might still 
be more of them here.

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:01.440
I'm going to patrol the area.

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:02.980
Bihmsberg, Makuah!

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:04.020
Yes, ma'am!

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:07.940
I hope I get to slice some flesh!

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:13.060
You know, Kahvel-san's dad told me...

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:16.390
When she was little,

00:12:16.390 --> 00:12:18.800
she was watching her dad 
train her older brother,

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:22.920
and he said that going up against 
living opponents with real swords

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:24.700
provided the most experience.

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:27.940
Apparently, that's what
his words impressed upon her.

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:30.800
I guess you'd say she misbrained it?

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:32.380
Kids are good at that.

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:33.900
M-Misbrained...?

00:12:33.900 --> 00:12:35.620
"Misheard," but with your brain.

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:36.810
What the heck?

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.280
I'm sorry...

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:50.850
<i>But I'm going to protect everyone.</i>

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:53.570
<i>I'll get back home alive</i>

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.630
<i>and realize my dream.</i>

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:58.470
<i>So I have to</i>

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:01.090
<i>cut flesh, too.</i>

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:06.970
m 0 0 l 258 0 l 258 200 l 0 200

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:06.970
<b>[Threat Level]</b>

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:06.970
►The monster threat levels that Chefs can detect 
using their skills are expressed in eight tiers
from G to S.

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:16.260
What happened?!

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:17.980
Whoa, there.

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:19.590
Oh, man...

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:20.910
Guess we didn't see it there.

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:24.830
I'm afraid it's stuck fast.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:27.440
The wheel just about snapped.

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:28.880
Everyone okay?

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:29.830
I think so...

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:31.220
That freaked me out!

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:32.590
Bihmsberg...

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:33.850
We'll take care of it.

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:35.240
I'll help you out.

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:38.180
Here we go!

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:39.120
One...

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:40.070
Two, and...

00:13:40.070 --> 00:13:41.080
Three!

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:47.920
It raised up a little!

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:49.280
Slowly, now.

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:49.960
Right.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:56.600
Great Hero, we've almost got it!

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:01.140
All right! It's out!

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:08.890
That was easier than I expected.

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:10.170
You said it.

00:14:12.070 --> 00:14:14.110
All right, let's hurry on.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.160
Roger!

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:20.460
<b>Traverse 5% of the map (Currently 1.76%)</b>

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:20.460
<b>Deliver the goods to Radodorbo</b>

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:20.460
<b>Time remaining: approx. 15 days, 5 hours</b>

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:20.450
We have about fifteen days 
and five hours left...

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:22.760
It'll be close.

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:28.760
Kahvel-san, I see something.

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:33.800
An army being attacked by monsters?

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:37.320
Which army? I see some civilians, too...

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:38.810
And even a child.

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:41.010
We have to help them!

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:42.300
Are you serious?

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:45.550
We have no idea if we even 
have time to spare.

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:47.940
I'd rather make as few unnecessary 
stops as possible.

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:54.490
Then would you mind letting me off here?

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:57.680
I'll go alone if I have to.

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:58.410
What?!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:01.070
Hang on, Kusue! Think this through!

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:05.160
Weren't we going to make 
it back home alive?

00:15:05.160 --> 00:15:07.000
If completing the quest is 
required for that, we can't—

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:08.000
I'm sorry.

00:15:08.370 --> 00:15:11.310
But remember what I said before?

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:12.040
What?

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:16.200
That saving someone's life isn't all 
there is to "saving" them.

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:17.650
Uh, right...

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:20.210
And you know...

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:23.130
if I abandoned a child...

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:26.180
there'd be no point anymore.

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:27.840
So...

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:29.770
I just can't.

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:31.780
<i>Wait, what?</i>

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:36.030
<i>"If I don't save the kid, there's no 
point in living the rest of my life"?</i>

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:39.240
<i>Damn, just how badass are you?</i>

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:42.990
Although, you know,

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:45.680
this could be some kind of event.

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:46.860
Event?

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:51.090
Like, Game Master's watching to 
see if we save them or not?

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:55.500
As an example... those guys could 
be on their way to Radodorbo.

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:56.940
Ah...

00:15:57.310 --> 00:16:00.620
Okay, on that note, 
let's split into two groups.

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:03.010
I'll head out there with Hakozaki-san.

00:16:03.010 --> 00:16:05.730
The rest of you can go on ahead.

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.360
What? We're splitting up?

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:10.340
We'll get it done and catch 
up as fast as we can.

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:12.160
You okay with that?

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:13.330
Yeah.

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:22.830
They're nearly wiped out already, though!

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:29.580
Wh-What?!

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:31.710
They all turned toward us!

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:33.800
Another consequence of being heroes?!

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:36.940
<i>Meri kobolds... the kobold family.</i>

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:40.400
<i>Threat level E. So they're stronger 
than one of the kingdom's soldiers...</i>

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:43.810
Hell, just one is stronger 
than the two of us combined!

00:16:43.810 --> 00:16:44.960
Are those...

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:46.190
Heroes?

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:49.580
We'll draw them to us! 
Attack them from behind!

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:50.770
Got it!

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:55.360
<b>Kite Shield</b>

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:55.360
<b>Short Sword</b>

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:09.290
<b>Hakozaki Kusue</b>

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:09.290
<b>Dead</b>

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:09.290
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:13.510
<i>It's no use! They outnumber us, 
they're stronger than us,</i>

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.940
<i>and they're all heading for us at once!</i>

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:20.750
Hey! Look behind you!

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:25.100
<i>It didn't work! Wait, they don't 
understand human speech?!</i>

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:30.350
I'm not done yet!

00:17:35.750 --> 00:17:36.870
Now you're—

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:39.950
<b>Yotsuya Yuusuke</b>

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:39.950
<b>Dead</b>

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:39.950
<b>Reviving in</b>

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:41.400
Back attack!

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:47.790
<i>Why am I even here?</i>

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:50.170
<i>There's no point if I can't fight.</i>

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:14.280
<i>If I have to be protected again, 
it'll all amount to nothing.</i>

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:27.870
<b>Kite Shield</b>

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:28.330
<b>Longsword</b>

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:28.790
<b>Short Sword</b>

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:44.560
<b>Longsword</b>

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:53.300
<i>She got it to let its guard down,</i>

00:18:53.300 --> 00:18:55.490
<i>then summoned her longsword 
at the last second.</i>

00:18:55.490 --> 00:18:59.150
<i>Since it was so quick, that offset the issue 
of it being too heavy for her to lift,</i>

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:00.900
<i>killing two birds with one stone.</i>

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:07.480
<i>Has Hakozaki-san's character changed?</i>

00:19:07.860 --> 00:19:09.250
<i>In any case...</i>

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.620
There's just one left!

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:14.410
Yes!

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:16.880
Hey! Over here!

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:18.480
Great Hero!

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:32.550
<i>What lovely flesh.</i>

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:43.630
What's their deal?

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.570
I guess they're just shy.

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:50.620
So the surviving soldiers and civilians 
total... three, four... six?

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:54.000
There are still some with injuries. 
Can you help them all?

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:55.930
Yeah, I think so.

00:19:55.930 --> 00:20:00.880
I absorbed some magic from the 
monsters' blood to replenish my MP.

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:02.710
You can do that?

00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:05.010
That berserker at the bandits' hideout

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:09.960
apparently got that way by eating 
too much flesh imbued with magic.

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:12.760
So I figured it should be 
possible to absorb it, too.

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:15.790
You should've brought this up sooner!

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:19.010
Well, this was my first time trying it.

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:20.200
Great Hero...

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:24.000
Thank you so much for everything.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:25.040
Sure.

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:27.740
So what is this group you're with, 
and where are you headed?

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:30.990
We are soldiers of the Kingdom of Deokk.

00:20:30.990 --> 00:20:36.130
On the king's orders, we are transporting 
these heretics to Radodorbo.

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:37.260
Huh?

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:39.670
<b>Traverse 5% of the map</b>

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:39.670
<b>Deliver the goods to Radodorbo</b>

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:39.670
<b>(Time limit: 40 days)</b>

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:45.950
These heinous criminals violated our ban 
on the foreign religion known as Arteros.

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:51.200
Since it is believed that Radodorbo is home to 
the greatest number of secret Arteros devotees,

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:54.100
we are going to publicly execute 
them atop a hill there.

00:20:54.410 --> 00:20:57.370
<i>Radodorbo! It actually came up!</i>

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:00.550
<i>We still don't know what the "goods" are.</i>

00:21:00.770 --> 00:21:03.370
<i>Humans? Death row convicts?</i>

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:07.780
<i>Heretics... A child? What's going on?</i>

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:10.260
<i>Are these people the "goods"?</i>

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:15.350
<i>But if we take them there, 
they're gonna be killed, including the kid.</i>

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:18.640
<i>A human attack has been detec.</i>

