00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:24.570
But it's okay if people die 
as a result of our actions?

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:28.470
<i>Is this event part of the quest?</i>

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:31.240
<i>Or do we fail if we help them?</i>

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:32.920
<i>Which...</i>

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:34.890
<i>is it?!</i>

